<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12016" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεύχομαι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>wish</i> a thing <i>away, wish it may not
			happen,</i> c. acc. rei, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπεύχου ταῦτα, πρὸς θεῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					E.
					<u>Hipp.</u>
					891
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τί μάλιστ᾽ ἂν ἀπευξαίμεθα;</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					20.157
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. τι τοῖς θεοῖς μηδαμῶς
				γίγνεσθαι</span>
			<i>pray</i> the gods it <i>may not be,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				687d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				D.
				8.51
			</span></i>: without 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή, ἀπεύχεσθε ἰδεῖν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					6.23
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				20.106
			</span></i>: also <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τοῦτο . . μὴ γένοιτο . .
				ἀπεύχομαι</span> Ar.<i><span class="en">
				Th.
				714
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>reject, despise,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μητρὸς αἷμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Eu.</u>
					608
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>auert by prayer,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Philostr.
				<u>VA</u>
				6.41
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
